Description: replace YAML gemspec dump with a Ruby gemspec
 gem2deb loads gemspecs as Ruby code during the clean/install phases.
 The unpacked gem carried a YAML-serialized specification, which OBS
 rejects as invalid syntax.
Author: hao <hao@local>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-03-15

